sgp 2

construct
  point A on xaxis
  point B on yaxis
  segment AB
    d1: |AB| = 4
  point C on AB
    x_C: x(C) = 1
    y_C: y(C) = 1

find
  y_B: y(B)

where
  A (1.3621999926632444, 1.7872629883913549e-31)
  B (1.1709654061874394e-31, 3.760905632954416)
  C (1, 1)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  x_C label (0.3, 0.3)
  y_C label (0.3, 0.3)
  y_B label (0.3, 0.3)
